(Now we need to ensure candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha (we will assign).)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_skill_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha (we will assign).)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta compliance_certificate_alpha (we will assign after releasing from alpha).)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_beta true (we will verify).)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta true (we will stage).)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_clearance_established shift_candidate_beta true (we will establish).)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha and beta true (we will finalize each).)
(Now we need to ensure compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha true (we will verify then release certificate).)
(Now we need to ensure constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha true (we will apply).)
(Now we need to ensure operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha true (we will confirm after assigning operator and applying constraint).)
(Now we need to ensure origin_availability_confirmed true, origin_availability_locked true, origin_node_occupied true, origin_node_ready true (we will achieve via load/unload).)
(Similarly for destination.)
(Now we need to ensure transport_leg_assembled true, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, transport_leg_loading_authorized true (we will assemble and authorize).)
(Now we need to ensure loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha true, loading_container_loaded loading_container_beta true (we will load container onto leg).)
(Now we need to ensure dispatch_allocated true for each candidate, dispatch_ready true for each, dispatched true for each.)
(We will achieve dispatch_ready via finalize for schedule candidates and via mark_*_dispatch_ready for origin/destination? Actually we can also get dispatch_ready via finalize for schedule candidates. For origin/destination, we can use mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready. Those require origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized. We'll have those after we assemble leg and authorize loading. So we can use those to set dispatch_ready for origin and destination.)
(Alternatively we could finalize them via some other path? There is no finalize for origin/destination availability; only mark_*_dispatch_ready.)
(Thus we will use mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready.)
(Now we need to allocate dispatch slot before dispatch. For each candidate we need to allocate dispatch slot (action allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate). Precondition: dispatch_ready ?candidate, candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile, dispatch_slot_available, not dispatch_allocated ?candidate.)
(Thus we need dispatch_ready true, task_profile_linked true, slot available.)
(We will have slot available initially; after each allocate, slot becomes unavailable; after dispatch, slot becomes available again. So we can allocate, dispatch, repeat.)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_task_profile_linked for origin and destination availability (we attached earlier). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure candidate_task_profile_linked for shift_candidate_alpha (already) and shift_candidate_beta (we will attach).)
(Now we need to ensure dispatch_allocated for each candidate after allocation (effect sets it true). It remains true after dispatch.)
(Now we need to ensure dispatched true after execute_*_dispatch.)
(Now we need to ensure vehicle_available for vehicle_unit_alpha and gamma after dispatches.)
(Now we need to ensure vehicle_allocated for destination_availability_alpha and shift_candidate_beta (we will allocate before dispatch). After dispatch, vehicle_allocated remains true (good). Also vehicle_available becomes true (due to dispatch effect). So both allocated and available true.)
(Now we need to ensure vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha remains true (already). After dispatch, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha becomes true (goal). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha remains true (not required). After dispatch, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma becomes true (goal). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta becomes true after allocation, and after dispatch vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma true (goal). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha becomes true after allocation, and after dispatch vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta becomes true (not required but okay). Goal does not mention vehicle_unit_beta availability, but it's okay.)
(Now we need to ensure that after we dispatch origin_availability_alpha, we have dispatched origin_availability_alpha true (goal). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure that after we dispatch destination_availability_alpha, we have dispatched destination_availability_alpha true (goal). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure that after we dispatch shift_candidate_alpha and shift_candidate_beta, we have dispatched them true (goal). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure that after we dispatch shift_candidate_alpha, we have compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha true (we will have done verification before dispatch). However note that verify_compliance_certificate sets compliance_validation_complete true, but does not affect dispatch_ready etc. We will finalize after verification.)
(Now we need to ensure that after we dispatch shift_candidate_alpha, we have candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha true (we will finalize before dispatch). finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation sets candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready. So we need to finalize before allocating dispatch slot and dispatching.)
(Thus order for alpha: after preparing (already prepared), we need to apply operational constraint, assign operator, confirm operator alignment, assign compliance certificate, verify compliance, release compliance certificate, finalize (via compliance validation path), allocate dispatch slot, dispatch.)
(Now we need to ensure that after we release compliance certificate, we still have compliance_validation_complete true (yes). The release action does not affect it.)
(Now we need to ensure that after we release compliance certificate, the certificate becomes available again for beta.)
(Now we need to assign skill certificate to beta (we haven't used it yet). We'll assign after preparing beta.)
(Now we need to assign operator to beta (after we release operator from alpha). We'll need to assign operator to beta before we lock? Actually beta does not require lock; we need operator for candidate_operator_linked (goal) and for verify_loading_profile_nominal (requires candidate_operator_linked). Also for loading container onto leg? No. So we need operator linked to beta before verify loading.)
(Thus we need to assign operator to beta before verify loading.)
(Now we need to assign skill certificate to beta before verify loading (requires skill_certificate_linked).)
(Now we need to assign compliance certificate to beta before establish clearance (requires candidate_compliance_certificate_linked). We'll assign after we release from alpha.)
(Now we need to ensure we have not used up equipment resources etc. Goal does not require equipment_reserved or equipment_confirmed etc. So we can ignore.)
(Now we need to ensure we have not violated any negative preconditions (like not (something) that becomes true). We'll track.)
(Now we need to produce plan lines.)
(Let's outline steps with actions and arguments.)
(We'll use the exact object names as given.)
(Objects:)
(- origin_availability_alpha (type origin_candidate_availability))
(- destination_availability_alpha (destination_candidate_availability))
(- shift_candidate_alpha (schedule_candidate))
(- shift_candidate_beta (schedule_candidate))
(- vehicle_unit_alpha, vehicle_unit_beta, vehicle_unit_gamma)
(- route_task_profile_alpha)
(- driver_operator_alpha)
(- cargo_payload_alpha)
(- origin_node_alpha)
(- destination_node_alpha)
(- transport_leg_alpha)
(- loading_container_alpha)
(- loading_container_beta)
(- equipment_resource_alpha)
(- equipment_resource_beta)
(- service_window_alpha)
(- service_window_beta)
(- dispatch_slot_alpha)
(- skill_certificate_alpha)
(- operational_constraint_alpha)
(- operational_constraint_beta)
(- compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now we need to allocate vehicles etc.)
(Let's list actions we will use:)
(1. attach_task_profile for origin_availability_alpha)
(2. confirm_candidate_preparedness for origin_availability_alpha)
(3. load_origin_payload for origin_availability_alpha)
(4. unload_origin_payload for origin_availability_alpha)
(5. attach_task_profile for destination_availability_alpha)
(6. confirm_candidate_preparedness for destination_availability_alpha)
(7. load_destination_payload for destination_availability_alpha)
(8. unload_destination_payload for destination_availability_alpha)
(Now for shift_candidate_alpha:)
(We need to apply operational constraint: apply_operational_constraint shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_alpha (true), candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha (true from init), not constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha (currently false). Good.)
(Effect: constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha true, not operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_alpha (makes it unavailable).)
(Now assign operator to alpha: assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha (true), operator_available driver_operator_alpha (true). Effect: candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha, not operator_available driver_operator_alpha.)
(Now confirm operator alignment: confirm_operator_alignment shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Preconditions: constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha (true after apply), candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha (true), not operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha (false). Effect: operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha true.)
(Now assign compliance certificate to alpha: assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha (true), compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha (currently true? Not used yet). Effect: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha, not compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha.)
(Now verify compliance certificate: verify_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Preconditions: operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha (true), candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha (true), not compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha (false). Effect: compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha true.)
(Now release compliance certificate: release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha (true). Effect: compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha true, not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha.)
(Now finalize candidate after compliance validation: finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation shift_candidate_alpha)
(Preconditions: compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha (true), not candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha (false). Effect: candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha true, dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha true.)
(Now allocate dispatch slot for alpha: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate)
